      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Update: This turned out to be a transitioning bug from 1935 to 1936.\n\nWith the 1936-adjacent SDK, a contact receiver with `advancedParameters: true` (note this field is an enum now, not a bool) still looked fine in the Unity inspector, but failed to build properly and the associated parameters were stripped from the avatar at upload time. Using the new enums introduced in 1936 resolved the issue.",
